SUMMARY:MICO: Running From A Feeling Tour
LOCATION:Paradise\, 967 Commonwealth Ave\, Boston\, MA 02215
DESCRIPTION:Born and raised in Toronto\, 23-year-old Filipino-Canadian arti
 st MICO (real name Miguel Veloso) first built a devoted audience online th
 rough Discord performances\, TikTok\, and self-released music before evolv
 ing into a rapidly rising global act. Following a series of breakout relea
 ses and sold-out headline tours across North America and Europe\, MICO now
  steps into his boldest era yet with his debut album "When the lights turn
  on" via Columbia Records. Balancing hyperpop chaos\, soaring pop hooks\, 
 and explosive alternative energy\, the album showcases MICO?s most persona
 l and ambitious songwriting to date\, cementing him as one of alternative 
 pop?s most exciting new voices.\nhttps://www.ticketmaster.com/mico-running
 -from-a-feeling-tour-boston-massachusetts-11-02-2026/event/010064ADC6946F0
 F\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
