SUMMARY:Menopunks Live!
LOCATION:The Rockwell\, 255 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:AWARD WINNING FILMMAKER/PHOTOGRAPHER Alicia has directed over 3
  dozen MUSIC VIDEOS FOR ARTISTS LIKE FIRST AID KIT\, CAKE and BOB MOULD as
  well as VISUALLY BRANDING popular bands like THE DECEMBERISTS and many ot
 hers with her imaginative portraiture. Her unique sense of visual style\, 
 grounded humor and snappy storytelling enables her to deliver authentic na
 rratives that resonate deeply with viewers. Her hit web series THE BENEFIT
 S OF GUSBANDRY received wide acclaim from press outlets like THE NEW YORK 
 TIMES and ENTERTAINMENT WEEKLY. Her feature directorial debut A KADDISH FO
 R BERNIE MADOFF won multiple awards and is widely available. She is curren
 tly helming Jewish feminist discovery episodic GIRLS IN TROUBLE: THE SERIE
 S. Rose is also noted lifelong musician with a storied history as a colleg
 e radio DJ\, tastemaking rock show promoter and indie music distribution b
 usiness leader.\nhttps://therockwell.org/calendar/menopunks/\nFrom Pushpin
  Boston: https://pushpin.city/boston/
URL:https://therockwell.org/calendar/menopunks/
END:VEVENT
