SUMMARY:Action Bronson and Human Growth Hormone
LOCATION:Roadrunner\, 89 Guest St\, Boston\, MA 02135
DESCRIPTION:Like all great competitive warriors\, Action Bronson uses every
  perceived slight as fuel to be even better. The rare rapper to marry crit
 ical acclaim with a devoted\, rabid following\, Action Bronson isn’t any
 one’s idea of an underdog. And yet\, on his brilliant new album\, Cocodr
 illo Turbo\, he sets out to prove that his lingual versatility is stronger
  than it’s ever been\, that age has only made him a better rapper\, and 
 that anyone still sleeping on him as one of the best MCs on the planet bet
 ter wake the hell up.\nhttps://www.axs.com/events/1597280/action-bronson-a
 nd-human-growth-hormone-tickets\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city
